  "solution": {
    "text": "From 0 to 1 hour, <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">'</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msup></math>  <br/>From 1 hour onwards <math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>  <br/>So at <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> hour, <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">'</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math>  <br/><math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>  <br/><math><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"true\">∫</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow></msubsup><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"true\">∫</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mrow></math>  <br/><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>  <br/><math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math>  <br/><math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>  <br/><math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>  <br/>Which is following <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>"
